  "$comment": "Blender-built play and yard things (tools/art/blender/families/yard.py). Listed in the base manifest's packs. The materials map onto the game's finishes so a model costs one draw call per finish group. A sand castle grows in the sandpit, the bike lifts its back wheel and turns it, the raised bed's crop grows and is picked, the shed's and the greenhouse's doors open (and the vent), the compost bin's lid lifts and the washing goes out on the line a line at a time and stays out.",
